<title>INDIA: India's NSE closes trade, to resume at 1215 hours.</title>
<headline>India's NSE closes trade, to resume at 1215 hours.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>A technical problem at India's National Stock Exchange (NSE) on Monday forced the exchange to close trade at 1115 (0545 GMT), NSE officials said.</p>
<p>The bourse is expected to resume trade from 1215 (0645 GMT), officials said. The NSE's 50-stock index was up 0.45 points or 0.05 percent, to 932.10 just before close.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
